---10.Find orders placed in the last 30 days using a subquery.
SELECT *
FROM Orders
WHERE Order_Date >=
(
    SELECT SYSDATE - 30
    FROM DUAL
);
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;

---11.Retrieve employees who are working in the 'HR' department and have a salary greater than 60,000.
